  dialogues:
  - text: This year is struggling so the Orphant fund got so little of money
    npcId: sara
  - text: I cannot convince people donate more so i have to turn to the wealthiest
      of us all, the guild. Not to mention that pig Vance never do anything for the
      village.
    npcId: sara
  - text: Well, i think the Temple and those kids will have worse meal for few more
      months.
    npcId: sara
  - text: You will have my vote if you promise to donate to the guild that amount
      of money after the election.
    npcId: sara
